  "description": "Perfect for everyday life – and escaping it. The GHOST E-ASX Universal EQ is a true crossover e-bike, suitable for the last mile in the city, as well as for off-road use and micro adventures. With its streamlined, angular design, this full-suspension e-mountain bike is a true fashion statement. Thanks to lights, mudguards, and a rear rack, you're equipped for any mission – whether in the urban jungle or on rough forest trails. The 160mm of travel up front and 150mm of travel at the rear are a true challenge to cobblestones, curbs, and root-filled trails, while the Bosch motor and 800WH battery provide the necessary power. Let the adventure begin!",
